Implemented and committed Part A.

Commit: `1c9346b Add Finder open auto-run handling`

What changed:
- Added `NSApplicationDelegateAdaptor` and `application(_:open:)`.
- Registered folders plus jpeg/png/heic/tiff document types in `Info.plist`.
- Routed Finder-opened folders/files into existing `AppState` loading methods.
- Auto-runs `exportAll()` when restored watermark/settings allow export.
- Brings the app UI forward when export cannot run yet, including first-use/no-watermark.
- Auto-quits 2s after successful auto-run when handling a fresh launch.
- Added XCTest coverage for folder-vs-file opened URL dispatch.

Verification:
- `xcodebuild ... build` with `-derivedDataPath /tmp/WatermarkFactoryDerivedData`: passed.
